OL,3,GNEWSAMore flights delayed after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlight delays will continue on
OL,8,FWednesday after an air traffic control
OL,9,Fproblem in the UK cancelled hundreds of
OL,10,Fjourneys.
OL,12,FTens of thousands of passengers were
OL,13,Faffected by the disruption and tracking
OL,14,Fwebsite FlightRadar24 said up to 1,000
OL,15,Fflights were cancelled after a glitch
OL,16,Faffecting air traffic control provider
OL,17,FNats.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
